{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0702/a293ec5906c1c94.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>DeepSeek官方狀態頁面顯示，DeepSeek網頁/API 出現性能下降問題，已定位原因，正在實施修復。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0702/e44c74ae1f45e8e.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w1125_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2026_27/A5A773DB7BE163FD4DCE31110BCB056A48CD5F50_size142_w1482_h1346.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>據了解，DeepSeek V4正式版計劃於7月中旬正式上線，將帶來更多功能優化和性能提升。同時，為了更合理地配置資源、提升服務穩定性，正式版發佈後將同步調整API定價策略，引入峯谷定價機制。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0702/da1cfd6898b0552.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0702/a293ec5906c1c94.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0702/e44c74ae1f45e8e.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w1125_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2026_27/A5A773DB7BE163FD4DCE31110BCB056A48CD5F50_size142_w1482_h1346.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-02T12:19:22.175398+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":7,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"unknown"}}